{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/52ae99062e5b8c7a8708b6980a790ee1.poster.avif?t=1757605332\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/52ae99062e5b8c7a8708b6980a790ee1.webm?t=1757605332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/52ae99062e5b8c7a8708b6980a790ee1.mp4?t=1757605332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>DASH</u></i></strong> your way through each stage of a worldwide bake-off, either on your own or with a friend in couch co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>DEFEAT</u></i></strong> Bee the Queen and stop her lackeys from rigging the competition and buying out the rest of the city through the missions of three unique campaigns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>REPLAY</u></i> </strong>as different characters to beat your high score and experience everything the game has to offer - from collectables and secrets, to stories and unlockable characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/2e5a425ecdf56859086eeb4e4e3d6232.avif?t=1757605332\" width=780 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features that <i>Claire a la Mode</i>\u00a0has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ Unique playable characters with their own strengths and weaknesses that change how you approach each level</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking chaos in each stage as you prepare your cake for the judges to win it all despite interference and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-op craziness to help or hinder your pals on your way to take down the cheaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible OST filled with all of the colorful sounds of <i>Claire a la Mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, snappy, arcadey fun (NO QUARTERS REQUIRED)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once in a lifetime opportunity for an experience full of baking delight!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2292860?t=1757605332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757605332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/1843cbec7cf84361de3df9df49c1112ad17a3d0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757605332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/1843cbec7cf84361de3df9df49c1112ad17a3d0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757605332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3291810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/52ae99062e5b8c7a8708b6980a790ee1.poster.avif?t=1757605332\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/52ae99062e5b8c7a8708b6980a790ee1.webm?t=1757605332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_